<protocol name="social_media" type="domain" domain="visual">

## PURPOSE

Platform specifications and style guidance for social media content.
Load when creating content for Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp, or Pinterest.

---

## PLATFORM SPECS

### Instagram

| Format | Aspect | Dimensions | Use |
|--------|--------|------------|-----|
| Feed Square | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Classic product |
| Feed Portrait | 4:5 | 1080x1350 | Tall products, detail |
| Stories/Reels | 9:16 | 1080x1920 | Full-screen |
| Carousel | 1:1 or 4:5 | 1080x1080/1350 | Storyline |

**Style**: High aesthetic, curated, generous negative space, aspirational.

### Facebook

| Format | Aspect | Dimensions | Use |
|--------|--------|------------|-----|
| Feed | 1.91:1 | 1200x628 | Link posts, ads |
| Square | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Engagement |
| Portrait | 4:5 | 1080x1350 | Mobile-first |

**Style**: More informational, lifestyle context, shareable.

### WhatsApp

| Format | Aspect | Dimensions | Use |
|--------|--------|------------|-----|
| Status | 9:16 | 1080x1920 | Full-screen story |
| Catalog | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Product listings |

**Style**: Direct, personal, quick to understand, less polished OK.

### Pinterest

| Format | Aspect | Dimensions | Use |
|--------|--------|------------|-----|
| Standard Pin | 2:3 | 1000x1500 | Primary |
| Long Pin | 1:2.1 | 1000x2100 | Infographics |

**Style**: Inspirational, text overlays welcome, vertical dominates.

---

## CAROUSEL CONSISTENCY

For multi-image sequences:
- **Lock lighting** direction across all slides
- **Lock color** temperature and grade
- **Lock background** treatment (or intentional progression)
- **First slide** = hook (stop the scroll)
- **Last slide** = CTA (drive action)

**All slides must feel like same photoshoot.**

---

## TEXT OVERLAY

### When to Use

| Yes | No |
|-----|-----|
| Price/offer posts | Catalog hero shots |
| CTAs | Gallery/detail images |
| Feature callouts | When packaging has text |

### Placement by Platform

| Platform | Safe Zone |
|----------|-----------|
| Instagram Feed | Bottom 20% |
| Instagram Stories | Top 15% or bottom 20% (avoid middle) |
| Facebook | Top or bottom 25% |
| Pinterest | Top third or bottom banner |

### Principles

- Text feels DESIGNED, not pasted
- Use brand typography
- High contrast for readability
- Never obscure product hero feature

---

## QUALITY ADDITIONS

For social content, add to standard quality checks:

```
[ ] Platform specs met (aspect ratio, dimensions)?
[ ] Platform style matched?
[ ] Scroll-stopping first impression?
[ ] Carousel/sequence consistent?
[ ] Mobile clarity verified?
```

</protocol>
